&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Media Futures Group:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Media Futures Group (MFG) is a bespoke team within WPP that delivers on our commitment to Google for a more strategic, creative and integrated media approach established to drive better business results.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The MFG team is made up of best in class digital, offline, and integrated media experts who work together to enhance media’s contribution to Google’s business. MFG is powered by WPP Media and other constituent parts of the WPP network around the world. The MFG team operates in a seamlessly integrated way across strategy, planning, investment, creative, production, business sciences and analytics, data and technology. The profile of people who work in MFG are world class, committed to establishing a new high water mark in the media industry.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MFG is committed to the growth of our people as a means to unleash the potential of Google’s business. We are invested in whole-person wellbeing, values and behaviors that reflect our mission and purpose, and providing the tools and systems needed to do the best work of your career. This is a team empowered by limitless possibilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role / Some of the things we’d like you to do&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is a team leader within the newly formed Global Applied Transformation function on MFG.&amp;nbsp; The Applied Transformation function is responsible for implementing large-scale, global changes as we partner with Google to radically transform marketing in an AI-fueled, data-driven, rapidly changing environment. The Program and Change management team is also responsible for leading projects / programs essential to day-to-day excellence and execution.&amp;nbsp; This role will be responsible for a team of Project / Program managers as well as creating a change management / communications capability.&amp;nbsp; As the program and change management lead, you will wear many hats…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As leader for the project and program managers team you will…&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide direct line management, mentorship and coaching to project managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define project management competency models and performance expectations across career stages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide a strategic direction for the project / program management discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish agile / adaptable standards and best practices for project and program management&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As a leader for a cadre of change managers you will…&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish agile / adaptable standards and best practices for change management and communications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish strong working relationships with Global Functional leads, Global POD leads and Regional leads to understand nuances and unique requirements across operational units that impact adoption and engagement.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a holistic change management / communications roadmap across transformation workstreams and BAU initiatives to ensure methods and approaches are designed to drive successful engagement and adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To achieve the above, maintain a “think global, act local” perspective. We should strive for consistency across regions, yet relevance in markets is mission critical.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Where appropriate, partner with the Talent team to leverage tools and expertise to support change journeys&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with key stakeholders and practitioners to proactively identify the impacts and effects of transformation initiatives. As part of this, provide a lens that considers our full organization at all levels and areas of specialism&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenge the status quo to ensure transformation initiatives are aligned to strategic priorities / objectives and driving step change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As a facilitator and collaborator you will…&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong working relationship across the WPP network and MFG team to ensure visibility, clarity, progress and strategic alignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across workstreams, projects and programs to solve unexpected issues, facilitating collaboration to stay-on track and removal of barriers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect the dots as needed across concurrent transformation initiatives to ensure dependencies and interlocks are addressed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with partners in Talent, Operations, and Finance to share context and operate in lock step with our business and people priorities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About yourself / Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project &amp;amp; Program Management / Process Design / Change Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on, roll-your-sleeves up, can-do leader who’s comfortable setting the vision, getting into the details, and able to connect the dots&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quintessential project and program planner who can plot the course from start to finish, anticipate and plan for risks, seamlessly shift between the strategic and tactical, and course correct as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience operating at a Director level&amp;nbsp; in a consulting / management consulting organization focused on transformation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SME level analytical and problem solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert process documentation, design and optimization skills working in conjunction with functional experts and practitioners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert level change management skills - understands various change management approaches / methodologies, able to create change strategy, identify audiences and personas, create / curate required artifacts, drive and track adoption / impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adept coach and mentor for Project / Program and Change managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communications and collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable having tough conversations with key stakeholders (internal and external)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written / verbal communication and storytelling skills including ability to tailor messages based on audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adept at conflict resolution and driving through conflicting priorities across diverse stakeholder groups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fosters an environment of inclusive collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lifelong learner / innovator / early adopter mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adept at learning new technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive problem identifier and solver&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embraces the opportunity to identify ways to leverage AI, automation and technology solutions to improve processes, drive efficiency and quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develops a deep understanding of Google’s business&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with ambiguity and breaking down complex problems into simple solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the global leader in Process Intelligence and the pioneer of Process Mining technology. As one of the world’s fastest-growing enterprise SaaS companies, we are changemakers pushing the boundaries of what’s possible. We invest heavily in advanced AI capabilities—specifically our Process Intelligence Graph—to turn data insights into immediate business action. We believe there is a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by placing intelligence at the core of every business process. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Celonis Services is the delivery engine of our Celonis Customer Organization, responsible for turning the Celonis platform into measurable, business-critical outcomes for our customers. In the AI era, our role has elevated: as AI agents like our own Apollo take on more of the technical build, our people focus on the work that drives real impact—understanding our customers&#39; business-critical problems, designing the solutions that solve them, and quantifying the value delivered. Our Deployment Engineers and Deployment Architects pair deep domain and industry expertise with serious platform mastery and AI-augmented delivery, directing agentic systems while owning the judgment, architecture, and customer relationships that AI cannot replace. We deliver faster and smarter than ever, and we own the outcome: initial value realization, adoption, and the long-term success of our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Lead Deployment Architect - AI (known internally Lead Deployment Architect)&amp;nbsp;you are the technical authority for our strategic accounts within Celonis delivery. You shape how Celonis solutions are designed, architected, and delivered across your portfolio of strategic customer engagements. You define what good delivery looks like - setting architectural standards, designing end-to-end solution strategies, and ensuring that AI-augmented and agentic workflows are deployed effectively at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You operate at the intersection of deep platform expertise, domain knowledge, and customer strategy. You are equally comfortable leading a technical design review with Celonis engineers and presenting a transformation roadmap to a customer’s C-suite. You bridge the gap between pre-sales and post-sales, ensuring that what was promised can be delivered - and often shaping the promise itself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role carries significant organizational leverage. You set delivery patterns that other teams follow. You define how AI agents should be orchestrated for complex, multi-workstream engagements. You work in close collaboration with Deployment Engineers and raise the bar for the entire practice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Work You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Architecture &amp;amp; Design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Services scoping in pre-sales, ensuring the right Services are positioned in line with the Celonis solution architecture proposed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design end-to-end Celonis solution architectures for complex enterprise deployments, spanning multiple process areas, business units, and geographies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the technical blueprint for how the Celonis platform integrates with customer systems, data strategies, and transformation goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing secure, scalable architectures tailored to complex enterprise requirements, optimizing for long-term usage growth and high concurrency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make architectural trade-off decisions: build vs. configure, custom vs. standard, phased vs. big-bang - with clear rationale tied to customer outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own solution quality &amp;amp; outcome delivery across engagements, conducting design reviews, and ensuring delivery teams follow architectural standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Orchestration &amp;amp; Delivery Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design how AI deployment agents (Apollo) should be used across complex, multi-workstream engagements, defining agent workflows, validation checkpoints, and quality gates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop reusable specifications, templates, and patterns that enable Deployment Engineers to direct AI agents more effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pioneer new delivery approaches that leverage AI to compress timelines, improve quality, or unlock use cases that were previously impractical&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set standards for AI output validation, ensuring the organization maintains quality as delivery accelerates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Strategy &amp;amp; Advisory&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the senior technical advisor to strategic customers, building trusted relationships with VP and C-level stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate customer business challenges into Celonis platform strategies, identifying high-impact use cases and defining success metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support pre-sales by providing technical credibility in complex deals, validating solution feasibility, and shaping project scope&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide customers through their Process Intelligence maturity journey, advising on platform expansion, AI readiness, and organizational change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage the broader ecosystem of Celonis experts to remove potential blockers in customer engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish deep, technical advisor relationships with customer stakeholders (Lead Data Engineers and Architects, Head of Data Intelligence, Head of Business Transformation) to provide technical reassurance and maintain &quot;Expert-to-Expert&quot; alignment during the course of the deployment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Successful Implementation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work together with Deployment Engineers on delivery projects to implement the most complex and cutting edge use cases for our customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay on top of the newest technologies Celonis has to offer and own the implementation of early stage products for our customers, ensuring close feedback cycles with Product &amp;amp; Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review Solution(s) Blueprint to ensure quality, scalability and production readiness of business critical and operational use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain &amp;amp; Industry Depth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain deep expertise in one or more process domains (e.g., Supply Chain, Order to Cash, Procure to Pay, IT Service Management) or industry verticals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate domain knowledge into scalable solution patterns, reference architectures, and best practices that the broader team can leverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and standardize high-value use cases within your domain in collaboration with the Deployment Engineer, collaborating with Product and Business Apps teams to shape the platform roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practice Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to hiring: define what great looks like for the Deployment job family, conduct interviews, and calibrate candidate assessments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share knowledge across the organization through internal enablement sessions, documentation, and community of practice leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the link with Product &amp;amp; Engineering to feed customer insights and field experience back into platform development, and to influence the platform roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Distinguishes This Role from Deployment Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scope: You work across multiple engagements and shape solutions across a portfolio/cluster/industry vertical (4+ concurrent clients)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence &amp;amp; Practice Development: your Scope allows you to identify and set standards that other teams follow - for solution architecture, AI orchestration patterns, and delivery quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bridge: You span pre-sales and post-sales, ensuring continuity between what’s sold and what’s delivered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Force multiplier: Your work multiplies the effectiveness of Deployment Engineers rather than substituting for it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Qualifications You Need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;8+ years in technical consulting, solution architecture, or delivery leadership within enterprise software, consulting firms, or system integrators. At least 3 years in a senior or lead technical role with multi-stakeholder responsibility in large-scale projects at tier-1 organizations (e.g. digital twin implementations, global AI transformations, near-real-time data pipelines, etc.)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architecture skills: &lt;/strong&gt;Proven ability to design complex, multi-component solutions that span data integration, process intelligence, automation, and AI, while remaining grounded in the “so-what” of a customer’s process. Deep understanding of enterprise architecture patterns and trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform mastery: &lt;/strong&gt;Expert-level knowledge of the Celonis platform, including the Process Intelligence Graph, data modeling, advanced PQL, automation and orchestration engine, and AI modules. Ability to push the platform’s boundaries via a working knowledge of Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; agent orchestration: &lt;/strong&gt;Demonstrated ability to design AI-augmented delivery workflows leveraging frontier tooling (e.g., Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, etc.). Experience with context engineering, multi-agent system design, or AI validation at scale. Ability to define how AI should be used, not just use it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain expertise: &lt;/strong&gt;Deep knowledge in at least one major process domain or industry vertical. Ability to translate domain expertise into scalable solution patterns and credible customer advisory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer executive presence: &lt;/strong&gt;Track record of building trusted advisor relationships with VP and C-level stakeholders. Ability to present transformation strategies, defend architectural decisions, and navigate complex organizational dynamics. Demonstrated experience navigating complex IT landscapes and communicating technical trade-offs to senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consulting &amp;amp; communication: &lt;/strong&gt;Exceptional ability to translate between technical and business audiences. Experience leading workshops, design sessions, and strategic reviews with senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; mentoring: &lt;/strong&gt;Demonstrated ability to raise the performance of teams around you. Experience mentoring technical staff, setting quality standards, and contributing to organizational capability development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education: &lt;/strong&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s in Computer Science, Engineering, Technology Management, Business Informatics, or a comparable field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages: &lt;/strong&gt;Fluency in English and German required.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Celonis makes processes work — for people, companies, and the planet. Powered by process mining and AI, the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform integrates process data and business context to create a living digital twin of business operations. We enable thousands of companies worldwide to understand how their business actually runs and, together with their partners, build intelligent solutions that transform and continuously improve the way they operate — unlocking billions in value. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a href=&quot;https://academy.celonis.com/learn/video/discover-the-ems&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions designs, builds, and operates the growth systems that competitive businesses rely on. In a world where Al is reshaping how companies drive growth, we lead clients in business transformation and marketing modernization, connecting strategy directly to execution. Our 12,000 experts in engineering and platforms, commerce, consulting, content transformation, CRM, and CX work within a unified global operating unit across 40+ markets. WPP Enterprise Solutions works alongside best-in-class partners including Adobe, AWS, Braze, Google, Microsoft, Salesforce, and Shopify, as well as innovators in AI, to deliver growth solutions tailored to the needs of our clients’ businesses. VML, part of WPP, supports WPP Enterprise Solutions by helping brands activate transformation through creativity and experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Senior UI Designer needed on a contract basis to join our rapidly expanding CX team, where you will work alongside Leads in UX, UI and Service Design, Optimisation and Consulting in the UK.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The opportunity&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are looking for a contract Senior UI designer who wants to work at the forefront of digital design, working within a cross-functional creative team to design interfaces which improve the user experience and ultimately increase conversion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This role is ideal for a strong&amp;nbsp;individual, who&amp;nbsp;is passionate about design. One who can think conceptually and lead the execution of online visual identity as well-being skilled in conversion-led design for transactional websites.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You’ll&amp;nbsp;create digital brand look and feel, and design pixel perfect responsive interfaces for clients, ensuring you meet both user and business needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You’ll&amp;nbsp;have&amp;nbsp;experience of&amp;nbsp;working with design systems to create design&amp;nbsp;work at&amp;nbsp;scale, along with an understanding of user&amp;nbsp;centred&amp;nbsp;design best practice, conversion&amp;nbsp;design&amp;nbsp;and accessibility principles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Your work will be of the highest standard and will impress clients and resonate within the&amp;nbsp;eCom&amp;nbsp;landscape, owning a compelling portfolio of digital design work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You’ll&amp;nbsp;be hands-on and willing to work in a&amp;nbsp;fast paced, ever-moving environment.&amp;nbsp;You’ll&amp;nbsp;keep&amp;nbsp;up-to-date&amp;nbsp;with the latest advances in technology, design&amp;nbsp;trends&amp;nbsp;and tooling.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You’ll&amp;nbsp;be able to communicate your design ideas and solutions to clients and other members of the team, whilst confidently defending your design decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will work closely with stakeholders, fellow designers, UX consultants, product managers, and developers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we want from you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience using design systems on a large consumer facing brand.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Demonstrable&amp;nbsp;eCommerce&amp;nbsp;experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Excellent design skills, proficient in Figma, Sketch and Adobe Creative Suite.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Creative, yet meticulous. Detail oriented with a keen sense of craftsmanship.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Great attitude, strong work&amp;nbsp;ethic, excellent communication skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ability to manage&amp;nbsp;own&amp;nbsp;projects and to work quickly and accurately to tight deadlines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Able to multi-task, with excellent problem-solving abilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Able to present concepts and design decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Enthusiastic, self-confident&amp;nbsp;and self-motivated.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Willing to adapt and take on new challenges and&amp;nbsp;driven&amp;nbsp;to continually improve.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Passion for technology and web-based applications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience working in a digital or creative agency or in-house design studio&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
