&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-2822&quot;&gt;Nice to Have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-2822&quot;&gt; * Security Certifications such as CISSP, CCSP, Certified Kubernetes Security Specialist, or GCP/AWS/Azure security certifications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
